<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6556] setSchema() is case sensitive in the wrong way in Thin JDBC driver</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6556</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Suppose we have a cache with &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;cacheCfg.setSqlSchema(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;emp&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Then, both&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;conn.setSchema(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;emp&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
conn.setSqlSchema(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;\&quot;&lt;/span&gt;emp\&quot;&quot;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt; fail with error &quot;Failed to set schema for DB connection for thread &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;schema=&amp;quot;emp&amp;quot;&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;conn.setSchema(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;EMP&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;works which is confusing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
